          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. (Pṛthūdakasvāmī, commentary on Brahmagupta's Brāhmasphuṭasiddhānta, c. 864 CE) A “hasta” (meaning \"forearm\") refers to a unit of length measuring around 18 inches."
