            0.364,
            0.882,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A pool 30 hastas long is dug to different depths along its length. It is divided into 5 sections having lengths 4, 5, 6, 7, and 8 hastas, and is dug to depths of 9, 7, 7, 3, and 2 hastas, respectively. Find the mean depth of the pool."
